            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa succede quando la condizione di questo ciclo while rimane <code>true</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Polly wants a cracker!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il ciclo si ripete all'infinito e manda in crash il programma</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il ciclo esegue il suo blocco di codice una volta</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il ciclo si ripete all'infinito e manda in crash il programma.</p></body></html>",
